{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261027%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 0930　27庭　法官高勁修<br/>宏福苑前法團委員江祥發與妻　涉詐騙「百分百擔保貸款」逾33萬元｜提訊<br/>► 1000　44庭　法官羅麗萍<br/>Deliveroo外賣車手送餐遇交通意外致永久傷殘　入稟追討工傷賠償｜傳票 (剔除經修訂之僱員補償申請)<br/>► 1000　32庭　法官陳廣池<br/>元朗區議員施駿興與女童非法性交罪成　非禮罪脫｜求情<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 1415　3庭　裁判官吳卓樺<br/>被指無牌經營食物製造廠等　社企膳心小館否認4罪｜審前覆核</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官鄭紀航<br/>涉駕私家車葵涌撞貨車　33歲休班警被控危駕等3罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　15庭　裁判官熊雪如<br/>廉署起訴房屋事務主任欺詐涉訛稱批出增加公屋戶籍及社區活動申請｜審前覆核</p>\n<p>🔸屯門法院<br/>► 1430　5庭　暫委裁判官李栩政<br/>六旬漢涉用鐮刀襲狗｜續審</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:23.766604+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":543,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:12:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.571337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:25.644948+00:00","content_hash":"9b12097b7de4b8bc89e8aa907642bc2f244d25d9cc1ca5690658ba681e51d51a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}